=== PARITY (vs web ChargingSessionDetailWidget.tsx) ===
  Data sources -> bound via the shared state-holder seam (ChargingSessionDetailSource ->
    ChargingSessionDetailModel): useVehicles + useChargingSessions + useChargingSessionDetail
    + useChargeTelemetry + useTranslation. The production app wires the source over the KMP
    charging stores; the view performs NO HTTP. The web latestSessionId reduce over
    useChargingSessions is reproduced as the pure, tested ChargingSessionDetailProjection
    .latestSessionID(from:). The aggregate isLoading = detailLoading || telemetryLoading is
    coalesced into ChargingSessionDetailLoadStatus.
  SI on disk -> the input DTOs carry SI (energyAddedWh in Wh, durationS in seconds, powerW
    in watts, socPercent), converted to display units ONLY at the projection boundary:
    energyKwh = Wh/1000 (web convertEnergyFromSI(...,'kWh')), powerKw = W/1000 (web power_kw),
    durationMinutes = floor(s/60) (web duration_min). No _mi/_min/_kwh/_kw field names added.
  Projection -> classifyCharger mirrors the web switch EXACTLY (nil/empty -> AC/Home; contains
    "supercharger"/"tesla" -> Supercharger; "<invalid>" -> AC/Home; else -> DC Fast). peakPower
    = max(power_kw) (default 0). durationStr = Xm / Hh Mm / Hh. stats = Energy Added (kWh) +
    Duration + Peak Power (kW) + Charger. All unit-tested + EXECUTED green (host AND simulator).
  Chart -> the web Recharts ComposedChart (green power <Area> on the LEFT axis + dashed cyan
    SoC <Line> on the RIGHT axis, domains [0, dataMax+5] / [0,100]) is ported to Swift Charts:
    AreaMark + LineMark (power, #22c55e) + dashed LineMark (SoC, #22d3ee), with the SoC mapped
    into the kW plotting space by ChargingSessionDetailScale so the trailing 0/50/100% axis
    lines up exactly. isWide drives axis tick density (web axisTick vs axisTickSm). Leaflet ->
    none (no map on this surface).
  Composition -> compact (cols<=1): large kWh-added figure (emerald) + "kWh added" caption +
    charger chip, or the empty surface (web isCompact branch). standard/wide (cols>=2): glass
    shell (bolt icon + "Charge Session Detail" title + freshness chip + refresh + Open) over the
    4-stat strip + dual-axis chart + legend; the empty surface when there is no session; a muted
    "No charge telemetry" note when a session resolves with no samples (web renders an empty
    chart area — never a blank box here).
  States (all render) -> loading (skeleton chrome; compact: number skeleton) · error (retry
    affordance) · empty "No charge sessions" · content · no-telemetry · stale (freshness chip)
    · offline (cached values + chip). Model phase keeps cached content visible behind a
    background refetch (web shell), a hard error replaces the body (web error -> WidgetShell error).
